; GoldAIBridge v1.04 - PROP preset for FTMO (firm 5% daily / 10% max loss; guard 4% / 8%, CE(S)T midnight reset).
; Token-free: paste the Telegram token/chat id in the EA dialog only. Set PropInitialBalance to the account size
; (0 = capture balance at first attach). AllowLiveAccount stays false; set true deliberately only if the account mode is REAL/CONTEST.
; See docs/prop-readiness.md.
